        "model": {
          "answer": "190%",
          "by": "sonnet",
          "agrees": null,
          "solution_html": "<p>a = 5·10²⁰+4,07·10²¹+8,5·10¹⁹ = 4,655·10²¹. b = 4·10²⁰−5·10¹⁹ = 3,5·10²⁰. a/b = 13,3.</p><p>c = ∛2000−∛54 = 10∛2−3∛2 = 7∛2. d = ∛250−∛128 = 5∛2−4∛2 = ∛2. c/d = 7.</p><p>(a/b) : (c/d) = 13,3/7 = 1,9 = 190%.</p>"
